# Hybrid workflow (Dominik + Cursor)

## Roles

| Dominik | Cursor agent |
|---------|----------------|
| Commit, push, merge PRs | Implement features and fixes |
| Production deploy (`scripts/deploy-prod.sh`) | Run tests/build in Docker |
| 30s smoke test on phone/desktop | Report changed files + ship checklist |
| Product/scope calls | DE/EN copy, i18n, minimal diff |

## Agent must NOT

- `git commit`, `git push`, `gh pr merge`, or SSH deploy — unless Dominik explicitly says *"commit and deploy for me"* in that turn.

## Every implementation ends with a **Ship** block

```markdown
## Ship
**Files:** …
**Commit message:** …
**Local check:** `docker compose run --rm frontend npm test && npm run build`
**Deploy:** `./scripts/deploy-prod.sh` (or `frontend` / `backend` arg)
**Smoke:** 1–3 concrete clicks (DE)
```

## Git note

Desktop folder may have a broken `.git`. Dominik commits from a healthy clone (`git pull origin main` first). Agent edits files in the workspace path; Dominik copies or commits from clone if needed.

## Default PR size

One owner-visible outcome per change. No drive-by refactors.
